  "sections": [
    {
      "heading": "A new fourth place",
      "sourceIds": [
        "board"
      ],
      "text": "Xz has broken into fourth on the ARC-AGI-3 public board at 52.95, landing between Team Turducken and the last dance. The overnight score event records a rise from 28.41 and 1,274th to fourth. At the morning close, Xz trails third-place Turducken by 3.07 points and leads the last dance by 1.44. That gives the chase behind the leading three a new contender."
    },
    {
      "heading": "Tufa crosses 70",
      "sourceIds": [
        "board",
        "person-yi-chia-chen-identity-0"
      ],
      "text": "Yi-Chia Chen @ Fields Model still leads at 75.56, but Tufa Labs has reached 70.02. An overnight event records Tufa moving up from 68.91; the current gap to Chen is 5.54. Turducken holds third at 56.02. NVARC3 also recorded a rise, from 48.84 to 49.54, and closes eighth. These event-to-event increases are separate from the edition’s midnight comparison, which is unavailable for those entries."
    },
    {
      "heading": "The gold door narrows",
      "sourceIds": [
        "board",
        "wire-2026-10-28-2359-arc-3-zhangzibo54-enters-gold",
        "wire-2026-10-28-1959-arc-3-architects-rise-to-twelfth"
      ],
      "text": "zhangzibo54 entered the gold places during the night, with the wire reporting a move from 24th to 16th at 39.22. By the morning close the gold score has risen to 38.98, leaving that recorded result only 0.24 above the threshold. The ARChitects are now 13th at 41.03: the wire’s earlier rise to 12th belongs to its preceding comparison window, rather than a fresh gain since midnight. Public medal places remain provisional."
    },
    {
      "heading": "Movement below the medal chase",
      "sourceIds": [
        "board",
        "wire-2026-10-29-0356-arc-3-forbeniusnorm-surges-to-forty-ninth",
        "wire-2026-10-28-2201-arc-3-carbonapi-jumps-into-top-hundred",
        "wire-2026-10-28-2359-arc-3-kimchikingdom-climbs-to-67th",
        "wire-2026-10-28-2359-arc-3-nimi-climbs-to-75th"
      ],
      "text": "Fighting Gold reaches 38th at 36.46, up 97 places and 3.05 points against the midnight baseline. ForbeniusNorm’s overnight score event took it from 635th to 49th at 35.81, a gain of 5.19. Earlier wire reports also followed carbonapi into 84th, kimchikingdom into 67th and NIMI into 75th; those are their dated wire positions, not refreshed morning placements. The breadth of the climb matters: the field is moving well below the gold line too."
    },
